  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"De\u011Fnek \u015E\xF6valyesi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nBa\u015Faraca\u011F\u0131na \xE7ok inanm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n {{isim}}.
    Bu kart, baz\u0131 hayallerinin ger\xE7ekle\u015Fmesi y\xF6n\xFCnde duydu\u011Fun
    arzuyu ifade ediyor. Umutlar\u0131n asl\u0131nda sana \xE7ok yak\u0131nm\u0131\u015F
    ve bunu t\xFCm benli\u011Finle hissetmi\u015Fsin. \u0130stedi\u011Fin her ne
    varsa elde edebilecek donan\u0131ma sahip oldu\u011Funu biliyormu\u015Fsun ve
    bu y\xF6nde gereken t\xFCm ad\u0131mlar\u0131 da atm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Kafana
    koydu\u011Fun \u015Feylerin t\xFCm\xFCne hen\xFCz ula\u015Famam\u0131\u015F olsan
    da, azmin ve h\u0131rs\u0131n \xE7evrendeki herkes taraf\u0131ndan \xE7oktan
    takdir toplam\u0131\u015F bile."
